|-----------|-------------|-----------|----------|
| `New()` | N/A | N/A | Initialization |
| `Get()` | ✓ | Read | Retrieval |
| `Set()` | ✓ | Write | Storage/Updates |
| `Delete()` | ✓ | Write | Removal |
| `Purge()` | ✓ | Write | Cleanup |

