    return Response{Error: "failed to save user"}
  }

  h.notifier.NotifyUserCreated(user)
  h.tracker.TrackUserCreated(user.ID)

  return Response{UserID: user.ID}
}
```

**Pattern**: Dependency Injection for all concerns  
**Testability**: All dependencies are mockable

