[2] Normalizer.Normalize(&req)
  ↓
[3] Repository.FindOrCreate(name, email)
  ↓
[4] Update user age
  ↓
[5] Repository.Save(user)
  ↓
[6] Notifier.Notify(user) [non-blocking]
  ↓
Response{UserID: user.ID}
```

